NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000484 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000485 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000486 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000487 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000488 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000489 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000490 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000491 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000492 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000493 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000494 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000495 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000496 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000497 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000498 "Dist::Zilla plugin and/or Pod::Weaver::Plugin. Any additional steps required"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000499 "beyond that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000500 ""
